# SARRUS LIFT — single-chain control: observe the deck with the motor held.
# Copyright (c) 2026 CrispStrobe. BSD-3-Clause.
# The passive perpendicular chain B is removed. Motor A holds its saved angle;
# nothing is driven. Watch whether the deck can stay level on chain A alone.
DEVICE SPIKE

WHEN flag clicked:
  lab start
  lab stop motor A hold
  wait 8 seconds
  say "Single-chain control complete: compare the deck with the full Sarrus Lift."
